{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2022-12-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'FOR THE FIFTH YEAR, ORACLE SCORES HIGHEST IN ALL USE CASES IN 2022 GARTNER® CRITICAL CAPABILITIES FOR CLOUD DATABASE MANAGEMENT SYSTEMS FOR OPERATIONAL USE CASES', 'text': 'GARTNER RECOGNIZES ORACLE AS A LEADER IN THE 2022 MAGIC QUADRANT™ FOR CLOUD DATABASE MANAGEMENT SYSTEMS AUSTIN, TEXAS, DEC. 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY GARTNER IN THREE RECENTLY PUBLISHED CLOUD DATABASE REPORTS. ORACLE IS A LEADER IN THE 2022 GARTNER "MAGIC QUADRANT™ FOR CLOUD DATABASE MANAGEMENT SYSTEMS".'}